  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNDP Sustainable Energy Investment Accelerator (SEIA) aims to strengthen the investment environment for clean energy projects, fostering just energy transitions at the national level. It focuses on enhancing energy governance, improving project bankability and financing access, promoting gender equality, and supporting digital transformation. With a human-centered approach, SEIA builds on global best practices to advance social and environmental benefits, particularly gender equality. Levera</narrative>
  </description>
