   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender &amp; Social Equality in Energy Finance</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and prompt energy finance frameworks that deliver gender equality results. This will be achieved by embedding the provision of technical assistance on gender equality and finance in the design of SEIA activities at national level, and the identification of key gender specialists and stakeholders who can function both as an extended source for expertise, and allies for disseminating information and good practices to increase awareness &#x2013;and ultimately investments&#x2014;on gender equality in the energy sector. This output serves as the anchor of the gender equality activities in the other three outputs, ensuring coherence through implementation.</narrative>
    </description>
