   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Energy Planning &amp; Governance</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">meaningfully address gender equality as part of energy planning and governance. This will be achieved by facilitating gender data to inform energy policy making, fostering spaces to amplify women&#x2019;s voices, securing the informed participation of gender machineries and women associations in the JETC, and ensuring alignment with SDG 5 is prioritize when developing impact assessment methodologies.</narrative>
    </description>
