   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Accelerator Facilities and innovation labs established</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will be achieved by, providing technical assistance to identify investment risks related to social or cultural norms, embedding gender equality objectives in SEIA supported financial products, encouraging the preparation of project specific gender analysis and gender action plans, including gender equality specific modules as part of skills development opportunities. Women&#x2019;s participation will be encouraged in skill development opportunities, with country-specific targets to be explored based on the initial gender analysis and ensuring outreach to women-led companies</narrative>
    </description>
